; MADRIGUERA - dungeon BG tileset (the mole king's burrow). VRAM slot shared with title.tiles
; (game.json vram_order [["dungeon", "title"], ...]): screen_build(JUEGO) must reload it.
; Packed earth mass (dark gray) with lumpy overhangs, light earth faces with roots, timber door
; frames, white calm floor. 3/4 view: the top wall shows a deep face, side walls a 4 px face,
; the bottom wall a 3 px lip. Tiles are referenced by label from res/metatiles.mt.
; Generated by a scratch script (room painted in screen coords, sliced, deduped); this file
; is the source of truth now. 50 tiles (budget 104, GDD 7.1).

